    "Id": "chassisdef_ostwar_OWR-2MX",
    "Name": "Ostwar",
    "Details": "A refresh of the Ostwar OWR-2M, the OWR-2MX replaces the LRM and Medium Lasers with an upgrade to double SRM6 launchers and 3 Extended Range Large Lasers. Using an XL engine and Endo Steel structure allows the switch to Double Heat Sinks for better cooling performance as well as an upgrade to a 325-rated fusion core. One large oddity is the fact the SRM6 launchers are in the legs, leading a strange angle of launching that can surprise enemy Mech Warriors.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
